---
import EarthworksLayout from '../layouts/EarthworksLayout.astro';
---
<EarthworksLayout title="Digmore — Dig More. Build More.">
  <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>EXCAVATOR TEETH &amp; WEAR PARTS</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title">DIG MORE.<br /><span>BUILD MORE.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-description">For the ground ahead.<br />And the work that never stops.</p>
        <p class="hero-detail">Excavator teeth, side cutters and adapters.<br />Find the right part for your machine.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-dark" href="/products">Explore the range <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/contact">Contact sales <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-bottom"><span class="eyebrow">THE WORKING END OF YOUR MACHINE.</span><a href="#product-range" aria-label="Scroll to product range">↓</a></div>
      </div>
      <figure class="hero-visual">
        <div class="hero-image-wrap">
          <!-- Stock application photography. Not a Digmore machine or product photograph. -->
          <img
            class="hero-image"
            src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/20760025/pexels-photo-20760025.jpeg?cs=srgb&amp;dl=pexels-gowtham-agm-609630353-20760025.jpg&amp;fm=jpg"
            srcset="https://images.pexels.com/photos/20760025/pexels-photo-20760025.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=480 480w, https://images.pexels.com/photos/20760025/pexels-photo-20760025.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=800 800w, https://images.pexels.com/photos/20760025/pexels-photo-20760025.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=1200 1200w, https://images.pexels.com/photos/20760025/pexels-photo-20760025.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=1800 1800w"
            sizes="(max-width: 799px) 100vw, 50vw"
            alt="Yellow excavator lifting rock in its bucket above a field of large stones"
            width="1200" height="1800" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"
          />
          <span class="image-corner-label">GROUND / WORK</span>
        </div>
        <figcaption><span>01 / EARTHMOVING IN ITS ELEMENT</span><a href="https://images.pexels.com/photos/20760025/pexels-photo-20760025.jpeg?cs=srgb&amp;dl=pexels-gowtham-agm-609630353-20760025.jpg&amp;fm=jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Photo: Gowtham AGM / Pexels ↗</a></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <div class="range-strip" aria-label="Product categories"><span>TEETH</span><span class="strip-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span><span>SIDE CUTTERS</span><span class="strip-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span><span>ADAPTERS</span><span class="strip-note">FIND YOUR FIT. GET TO WORK.</span></div>

    <section class="section product-range" id="product-range" aria-labelledby="range-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / THE RANGE</p><h2 id="range-title">THE PARTS THAT<br />MEET THE GROUND.</h2></div><p>Start with your machine.<br />We'll help you match the part.</p></div>
      <div class="product-list">
        <a class="product-row" href="/products"><span class="product-number">01</span><div class="product-name"><h3>EXCAVATOR TEETH</h3><p>Standard and rock-chisel profiles</p></div><span class="product-models">JCB · PC200 · EX200 · CAT</span><span class="round-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="product-row" href="/products"><span class="product-number">02</span><div class="product-name"><h3>SIDE CUTTERS</h3><p>Left- and right-hand wear parts</p></div><span class="product-models">JCB · CAT 424</span><span class="round-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="product-row" href="/products"><span class="product-number">03</span><div class="product-name"><h3>ADAPTERS</h3><p>Match your tooth and bucket assembly</p></div><span class="product-models">PC71 / EX70 · PC200 · EX200</span><span class="round-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="range-footnote"><p>Model names are selection guides. Confirm part number, dimensions and fitment before ordering.</p><a class="text-link" href="/products">View all products <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="application-section" aria-labelledby="fit-title">
      <div class="application-intro"><p class="eyebrow">02 / GET THE MATCH RIGHT</p><h2 id="fit-title">YOUR MACHINE.<br />YOUR GROUND.<br /><span>YOUR NEXT PART.</span></h2><p>Send us the details that matter. Let's take the guesswork out of your next order.</p><a class="button button-amber" href="https://wa.me/919410105848?text=Hello%20Digmore%2C%20please%20help%20me%20match%20a%20wear%20part.%0AMachine%20model%3A%20%0APart%20number%3A%20%0AApplication%3A%20%0AQuantity%3A%20" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discuss on WhatsApp <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      <div class="fit-steps"><div><span>01</span><h3>MACHINE &amp; MODEL</h3><p>Share the make and model of your excavator or backhoe.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>PART &amp; FITMENT</h3><p>Send a part number, dimensions or clear photos of the existing part.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>APPLICATION &amp; QUANTITY</h3><p>Tell us what you dig, how many parts you need and where to deliver.</p></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section closing-section" aria-labelledby="closing-title"><p class="eyebrow">03 / LET'S GET TO WORK</p><div class="closing-content"><h2 id="closing-title">MORE THAN A PART.<br />A CONVERSATION<br />ABOUT YOUR WORK.</h2><div><p>Questions about a product, a bulk requirement or a fitment? Talk to Digmore before your next order.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="/contact">Contact the team <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="closing-about text-link" href="/about">Get to know Digmore <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section>
  </main>
</EarthworksLayout>
